High temperature resistance of stainless steel fasteners: it is precisely because the hardness of stainless steel fasteners is strong enough, after production and processing,the fasteners have strong oxidation resistance, and they can work normally under high temperature, so they will not be interfered by high temperature. If stainless steel fasteners can be passivated at the same time after manufacture and before use, it will be better.
The negative rate of stainless steel fasteners: the physical properties of stainless steel fasteners have a very high negative rate, so compared with carbon steel wire rods, stainless steel fasteners are five times higher than its negative rate. After testing, we get that there is an expansion coefficient in the fastener.
Mechanical properties of stainless steel fasteners: in the mechanical properties, most of us know that the mechanical properties of many fasteners are closely related to the stainless steel wire rod. For example: no rusting, high corrosion resistance, etc., which are closely related to the properties of stainless steel.
Bolt: a kind of fastener composed of head and screw (cylinder with external thread), which is used to fasten and connect two parts with through holes. This type of connection is called bolt connection.
High strength self-locking nut is a classification of self-locking nut, which has high strength and strong reliability. It is mainly used for road construction machinery, mining machinery, vibration machinery and so on, which is mainly based on the introduction of European technology.
Anti loose device, and the vibration life is several times or even dozens of times higher. At present, more than 80% of mechanical equipment accidents are caused by the loosening of fasteners, especially in mining machinery
Stainless steel padlock: this kind of padlock is characterized by strong oxidation resistance and is suitable for outdoor use. However, due to the difficulty of processing and high cost, it is rarely used in China.
Copper padlock: the main material of the lock is copper, and the commonly used one is small copper padlock, which is less than 40mm in size, mainly because the copper price is relatively high.
