Hydraulic auger is a kind of auger equipment. Its working principle is to use hydraulic oil to let the motor drive the gear to rotate, thereby driving the output shaft, allowing the drill rod to work and performing hole forming operations.
➢ lInfiltrate into various materials faster, and choose different drill bit models, so as to realize the hole-forming operation of a variety of complex terrain and soil.
➢ lThe excavator auger drill is easy to install and disassemble. The operating radius can be at least 2-3 meters longer than the long auger
Of course there are shortcomings, the shortcomings of hydraulic auger:
● Not applicable to all projects
When buying an auger, you must keep the following points in mind:
Power source: Hydraulic auger can be operated with hydraulic power source or electric power source. Diesel and gasoline powered augers are more powerful, but they produce a lot of noise and are therefore not suitable for enclosed spaces.
Size: The size and length of the auger depends on your purpose. Larger diameter shafts can dig deeper holes.
Accessories: You can connect accessories such as blades or drill bits to your hydraulic auger to make it work, not just drill directly down
Hydraulic augers are very suitable for digging holes and can make your work easier. Therefore, if you are looking for a way to make your work faster and more efficient, it's time to buy a hydraulic auger.
