In the case of an accumulator in the structure of the hydraulic breaker, insufficient nitrogen storage will cause weak blows, and it will also easily lead to damage to the leather cup, and maintenance is also troublesome. Therefore, before the demolition breaker is working, you need to use a nitrogen meter to measure the amount of nitrogen and make a proper nitrogen reserve.
